{"seq":2,"slug":"claim-adjustment","title":"理赔审核/定损与自动判赔","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-border-insurance-claims/claim-flow/claim-adjustment","wordCount":3067,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"理赔审核-定损与自动判赔\">理赔审核/定损与自动判赔</h1><p>一份理赔申请加一条证据链，进去之后要出来三个答案：赔不赔、赔多少、由谁决定。这三个答案分别对应定损流程的三层——资格判定、责任判定、金额判定。本文讲这三层的实现方式、自动判赔的置信度门槛设计，以及转人工的正确判据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三层判定-只有两层可以模型化\">核心概念：三层判定，只有两层可以模型化</h2><p>把定损拆成三层不是理论上的洁癖，而是由<strong>错误的后果</strong>决定的。三层的错误代价完全不同，因此它们的实现方式必须不同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>错误后果</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n<th>可容忍的不确定性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>资格判定</td>\n<td>这张保单此刻是否可赔？</td>\n<td>直接资损（赔了不该赔的）</td>\n<td>硬规则，确定性</td>\n<td>零</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>责任判定</td>\n<td>损失是否由保单覆盖的原因造成？</td>\n<td>误赔或误拒，可事后纠正</td>\n<td>规则 + 模型，需解释</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金额判定</td>\n<td>赔付金额是多少？</td>\n<td>多赔或少赔，可事后调账</td>\n<td>公式 + 参数</td>\n<td>中（可用人工复核兜底）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>资格判定必须是纯规则且确定性为零容忍</strong>，原因很直白：它的每一条都是客观事实（保单状态、时效、重复索赔、是否在责任期内），没有任何模糊空间。把它交给模型是引入无谓的风险——模型可能因为特征分布漂移而在某个边界给出错误判断，而规则不会。资格判定的检查清单：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>保单存在且状态为 <code>ISSUED</code>（<code>ISSUING</code> 挂起，见 <a href=\"claim-report-evidence\">报案、举证与材料提交</a>）。</li>\n<li>出险时间落在责任期内（注意责任期可能与订单周期不同，见 <a href=\"../premium-underwriting/policy-issuance\">保单生成/绑定订单/承保确认</a>）。</li>\n<li>索赔提交时间在索赔时效内。</li>\n<li>损失标的是保单覆盖的标的（同一订单的多张保单不能互相索赔）。</li>\n<li>该损失未被赔付过（去重的键设计见下文）。</li>\n<li>投保人身份与索赔人身份匹配（跨境场景可能是商家为买家投保，此时索赔权归属需在条款明确）。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    C[理赔申请 + 证据链] --&gt; L1[第一层: 资格判定 硬规则]&#10;    L1 --&gt;|不通过| R1[拒绝: 附条款依据]&#10;    L1 --&gt;|通过| L2[第二层: 责任判定]&#10;    L2 --&gt;|明确不属于责任| R2[拒绝: 附条款依据]&#10;    L2 --&gt;|明确属于责任| L3[第三层: 金额判定]&#10;    L2 --&gt;|不确定| H1[转人工: 责任争议]&#10;    L3 --&gt; CALC[赔付金额计算]&#10;    CALC --&gt; GATE{置信度与金额门槛}&#10;    GATE --&gt;|高置信 + 低金额| AUTO[自动赔付]&#10;    GATE --&gt;|低置信 或 高金额| H2[转人工: 金额复核]&#10;    AUTO --&gt; OUT[赔付指令]&#10;    H2 --&gt; OUT\">graph TD\n    C[理赔申请 + 证据链] --&gt; L1[第一层: 资格判定 硬规则]\n    L1 --&gt;|不通过| R1[拒绝: 附条款依据]\n    L1 --&gt;|通过| L2[第二层: 责任判定]\n    L2 --&gt;|明确不属于责任| R2[拒绝: 附条款依据]\n    L2 --&gt;|明确属于责任| L3[第三层: 金额判定]\n    L2 --&gt;|不确定| H1[转人工: 责任争议]\n    L3 --&gt; CALC[赔付金额计算]\n    CALC --&gt; GATE{置信度与金额门槛}\n    GATE --&gt;|高置信 + 低金额| AUTO[自动赔付]\n    GATE --&gt;|低置信 或 高金额| H2[转人工: 金额复核]\n    AUTO --&gt; OUT[赔付指令]\n    H2 --&gt; OUT</pre><h2 id=\"责任判定-把条款变成可执行的映射\">责任判定：把条款变成可执行的映射</h2><p>责任判定的任务是把「保险责任条款」与「实际发生的事件」对齐。它的技术形态是<strong>事件到责任的映射表 + 判定规则</strong>。</p>\n<p>以运输险为例，条款覆盖「运输途中的灭失、损坏」，而系统能观测到的事件有：轨迹停滞超阈值、承运商上报破损、退回寄件人、异常签收（签收地异常）。把这些事件映射到责任需要一张显式的表：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>观测事件</th>\n<th>是否属于保险责任</th>\n<th>需要的附加证据</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>轨迹停滞 &gt; 阈值天数</td>\n<td>是（推定灭失）</td>\n<td>承运商出具的灭失确认</td>\n<td>不同承运商的确认可得性差异大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>承运商上报破损</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>无（承运商自认）</td>\n<td>最干净的赔案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退回寄件人（非买家原因）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>退回原因码</td>\n<td>需区分「买家拒收」与「无人签收」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>买家申报破损</td>\n<td>是（待核）</td>\n<td>图片证据 + 签收时间</td>\n<td>需排除签收后长时间才报损</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>买家申报未收到（DNR）</td>\n<td>视条款</td>\n<td>派送证明</td>\n<td>见 <a href=\"../insurance-products/shipping-return-quality-ins\">运输险/退货运费险/品质险</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>签收后 N 天才报损</td>\n<td>通常否</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>责任期已过的推定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>这张表的维护是理赔系统最核心的运营资产</strong>，它决定了赔案的自动率。每一条映射都需要由保险产品与法务共同确认（因为它本质是对条款的解释），并且在条款变更时同步更新。系统必须为这张表建立版本管理——因为一笔赔案的判定必须能追溯到当时生效的映射版本。</p>\n<p>责任判定的第二部分是<strong>排除项</strong>（exclusions）。绝大多数纠纷出在这里，因为排除项常带有主观判断（如「买方故意行为」「正常磨损」）。对排除项的处理原则是：能客观化的必须客观化（「签收后超过 N 天」优于「超出合理期限」），不能客观化的必须转人工（不要让模型去判断「是否故意」）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"去重-同一损失不能被赔两次\">去重：同一损失不能被赔两次</h2><p>多层去重是理赔系统防资损的关键。三层去重键：</p>\n<p><strong>第一层，按保单 + 标的 + 损失事件。</strong> 这是最强的去重：同一张保单的同一个标的、同一个损失事件只能有一个赔付。这里的关键是「损失事件」的身份定义——它需要一个稳定的标识，通常用「出险时间 + 出险类型」的组合，或直接用物流事件的唯一 ID。</p>\n<p><strong>第二层，按订单 + 损失类型跨保单去重。</strong> 同一订单可能挂多张保单（运输险 + 品质险），买家可能向两张保单同时索赔同一损失。系统必须能识别「这两笔索赔指向的是同一个损失」。这需要一个跨保单的损失指纹（loss fingerprint）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">FP = H(order\\_id \\| subject\\_id \\| event\\_type \\| event\\_time\\_bucket)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">bj</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">im</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 是哈希函数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">event\\_time\\_bucket</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">im</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 把出险时间归到一个时间桶（例如天）以避免时间戳的微小差异导致指纹不同。指纹冲突即判定为同一损失，后到的索赔被拒或合并。</p>\n<p><strong>第三层，跨订单去重（识别有组织骗赔）。</strong> 同一买家对不同订单的相似索赔、同一收货地址关联的多个账号的索赔、同一张破损照片被复用在多个索赔上。这一层属于反欺诈范畴，其检测特征与方法见 <a href=\"../insurance-ops/insurance-anti-fraud\">虚假理赔/骗保识别</a>。这里只强调一点：<strong>图片指纹（感知哈希）必须在这里被计算并存储</strong>，因为它是跨订单去重最有效的信号，且必须在材料提交时就计算（事后重算成本高且可能因材料已过期无法重算）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"金额判定与赔付基数的选择\">金额判定与赔付基数的选择</h2><p>金额判定的核心是一个选择：<strong>赔付基数是什么</strong>。这个选择对赔付总额的影响远大于任何模型精度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>赔付基数</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>订单商品金额</td>\n<td>商品标价（未扣优惠）</td>\n<td>运输险（全损）</td>\n<td>偏高——买家可能用了大额优惠券</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实付金额</td>\n<td>买家实际支付的总金额</td>\n<td>主流选择</td>\n<td>需正确拆分优惠分摊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商品金额 - 优惠分摊</td>\n<td>商品部分的实付</td>\n<td>品质险</td>\n<td>计算复杂，需订单侧提供分摊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重置成本</td>\n<td>在目的国重新购买的成本</td>\n<td>部分高价值险种</td>\n<td>跨境价格差异大，难以核定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运费实际支出</td>\n<td>退货运费实付</td>\n<td>退货运费险</td>\n<td>平台面单 vs 自寄，证据路径不同</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>跨境的特殊问题在「实付金额」的口径上：一笔订单可能包含多个商品、多个优惠（平台券、商家券、支付优惠、运费券），优惠需要在商品行之间分摊，否则单件商品的赔付基数无法确定。这个分摊逻辑属于订单与结算域的职责，理赔侧应该<strong>消费订单域提供的分摊结果</strong>而不是自己重算——否则两处口径不一致会导致赔付金额与退款金额对不上。分摊的实现属于订单结算域的能力，理赔侧只消费其输出。</p>\n<p>赔付金额的计算公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Payout = \\min\\left( \\max(0, Base \\cdot \\gamma - D), Cap \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Base</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span></span></span></span></span> 是赔付基数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 是赔付比例（道德风险抑制用，见 <a href=\"../premium-underwriting/2-risk-pricing-fraud\">风险定价与逆向选择/道德风险</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 是免赔额，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Cap</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 是赔付上限。<strong>注意 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span></span> 的顺序</strong>：先扣免赔额再封顶，是行业惯例；反过来（先封顶再扣免赔）会让高价值案件的赔付比例被双重削减，容易被认定为不合理的免责条款。这个顺序必须在条款里写明。</p>\n<p>赔款的长尾问题也在这里显现：一笔已经赔付的案件可能在后续被追回部分损失（例如承运商后来赔付了部分金额），此时需要**赔付调整（recovery adjustment）**而不是新开一笔赔案。系统必须支持对已结案赔案的附加调整记录，并保证这些调整能被正确归入原承保月的赔付率统计——否则赔付率会被调整记录污染。</p>\n<h2 id=\"置信度门槛与转人工\">置信度门槛与转人工</h2><p>自动判赔的核心问题不是「能不能自动」，而是**「什么时候不该自动」**。转人工的判据设计错误会同时造成两类损失：门槛太严则人工成本爆炸，门槛太松则误赔损失上升。</p>\n<p>正确的判据是比较<strong>期望成本</strong>，而不是比较模型的置信度分数。对一笔案件：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msubsup><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{auto} = p_{err} \\cdot L_{err}, \\quad C_{manual} = C_{review} + p&#x27;_{err} \\cdot L_{err}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">man</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0489em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{err}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是自动判定的错误概率（两侧错误都要计入：误赔与误拒），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{err}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是单次错误的期望损失，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{review}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是人工审核成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p&#x27;_{err}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9989em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是人工审核后的残余错误概率（不为零——人工也会错）。<strong>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{auto} &gt; C_{manual}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">man</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时转人工。</strong></p>\n<p>这个判据有两个反直觉的推论：</p>\n<p><strong>其一，误拒也要计入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L\\_{err}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></span>。</strong> 很多团队只把误赔算作损失，于是把门槛设在极保守的位置，导致大量真实索赔被拒、用户投诉、复购率下降。误拒的损失（用户流失、客服成本、声誉）虽然难以精确量化，但它是真实的。正确做法是给两类错误分别赋权（误赔通常权重大于误拒，但误拒不为零）。</p>\n<p><strong>其二，模型置信度不是判据本身。</strong> 置信度只是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{err}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的一个估计。如果模型在某个区间的置信度很高但历史错误率也高（校准不良），按置信度转人工就会漏掉这些案件。所以<strong>必须有校准监控</strong>：定期按置信度分桶统计实际错误率，如果分桶的错误率与置信度不匹配，说明模型需要重校准，此时应临时收紧自动判赔范围。</p>\n<p>转人工还有一个工程要求：<strong>转人工必须携带完整的判定上下文</strong>。审核员看到的应该不只是「模型判断不确定」，而是三层判定各自的结果、命中的责任条款、证据链的摘要、以及模型给出的理由（如果模型可解释）。缺少这些，审核员只能重新走一遍流程，人工成本翻倍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>定损分三层：资格判定（硬规则，零容忍不确定性）、责任判定（规则+模型，需可解释）、金额判定（公式+参数，可用人工复核兜底）——分层依据是错误后果而非理论洁癖。</li>\n<li>责任判定的核心资产是「观测事件 → 保险责任」的映射表，它需要版本管理，因为每笔赔案必须能追溯到当时生效的映射版本；排除项能客观化的必须客观化，不能的转人工。</li>\n<li>去重分三层：保单+标的+损失事件（最强）、订单+损失类型跨保单（用损失指纹）、跨订单诈骗识别（依赖感知哈希，必须在材料提交时计算）。</li>\n<li>赔付基数优先用订单域提供的「实付金额 + 优惠分摊结果」，理赔侧不要自己重算；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Payout = \\min(\\max(0, Base \\cdot \\gamma - D), Cap)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 中先扣免赔再封顶的顺序必须在条款写明。</li>\n<li>赔款长尾需要「赔付调整」机制而非新开赔案，且调整必须归入原承保月的赔付率统计。</li>\n<li>转人工的判据是期望成本比较（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{auto} &gt; C_{manual}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">man</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）而非模型置信度；误拒的损失必须计入；模型需要定期按置信度分桶做校准监控。</li>\n<li>转人工必须携带完整判定上下文（三层结果、责任条款、证据摘要、模型理由），否则人工成本翻倍。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>判定完成后进入执行环节：见 <a href=\"payout-flow\">赔付路径与平台垫付</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"理赔审核/定损与自动判赔","id":"理赔审核-定损与自动判赔"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三层判定，只有两层可以模型化","id":"核心概念-三层判定-只有两层可以模型化"},{"level":2,"text":"责任判定：把条款变成可执行的映射","id":"责任判定-把条款变成可执行的映射"},{"level":2,"text":"去重：同一损失不能被赔两次","id":"去重-同一损失不能被赔两次"},{"level":2,"text":"金额判定与赔付基数的选择","id":"金额判定与赔付基数的选择"},{"level":2,"text":"置信度门槛与转人工","id":"置信度门槛与转人工"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"报案、举证与材料提交","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-border-insurance-claims/claim-flow/claim-report-evidence"},"next":{"title":"赔付路径与平台垫付","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-border-insurance-claims/claim-flow/payout-flow"}}